		text = "OUT-OF-CHARACTER RULES"
	elem "label15"
		type = LABEL
		pos = 480,84
		size = 192x372
		anchor1 = 69,18
		anchor2 = 96,97
		font-family = "Ebrima"
		font-size = 9
		text-color = #ff0000
		drop-zone = true
		saved-params = ""
		text = "1. NO SPAMMING\n2. NO RACIAL OR HOMOPHOBIC SLURS YOU WILL BE MUTED.\n3. DO NOT BRING IC-DISPUTES TO OOC.\n4. NO LINKS TO EXPLICIT CONTENT OF ANY KIND.\n5. HAVE CONSIDERATION FOR NEW PLAYERS, IF THEY'VE ASKING QUESTIONS THAT MAY SEEM DUMB TO YOU-- REMEMBER THAT I MYSLEF AS THE OWNER HAVE FELT THE SAME WAY WHEN HELPING YOU. :) RESPECTFULLY."
		align = left
		text-wrap = true
		allow-html = true
	elem "label16"
		type = LABEL
		pos = 30,67
		size = 168x20
		anchor1 = 4,14
		anchor2 = 28,19
		font-family = "Ebrima"
		font-size = 9
		font-style = "bold underline"
		text-color = #f8f8f8
		background-color = #111111
		saved-params = ""
		text = "IN-CHARACTER RULES"
	elem "Guide1"
		type = LABEL
		pos = 16,84
		size = 192x372
		anchor1 = 2,18
		anchor2 = 30,97
		font-family = "Ebrima"
		font-size = 7
		text-color = #ff0000
		drop-zone = true
		saved-params = ""
		text = "1. NO NON-RPING(That goes for spars/playing around/etc.)\n2. NO METAGMING(If you do not know something IC, do not pretend to, even if you do OOCly)\n3. NO IC-AVOIDING(If someone RP's or talks to you, RP back, even if it's to ignore them.)\n4. NO DEATH AVOIDING(If you're logging out, or making OOC excuses constantly to avoid death or serious events, you'll be considered DAing)\n5. NO UN-CONSENTED RP(Harassing players in any sexual manner both IC and OOC is considered un-consented RP. Extreme punishment behind this.)\n6. PLAYERS MUST COUNTDOWN BEFORE ANY KILL RP AND AFTER ANY KNOCKOUT RP IF THEIR ARE OTHER RP'ERS AROUND.\n7. BE REALISTIC, NOT EVERYONE IS TRYING TO BECOME A TOP ELITE NINJA.\n8. IF A PLAYER ESCAPES FROM YOU VIA COUNTDOWN AND VERB-AVOIDING, YOU CANNOT PURSUE THEM IF THEY ARE NOT KNOCKED DOWN BEFORE THE NEXT MAP.\n9. IF YOU ARE ROGUE, YOU CANNOT ATTACK OR HARM STUDENTS, ONLY GENIN AND HIGHER.\n10. KAGES AND LEADER-RANKS ARE NOT ALLOWED TO HUNT/KILL ANYONE THAT DOESN'T ATTACK/HUNT/TRY TO KILL THEM FIRST.(THIS IS WHY YOU HAVE A VILLAGE OF NINJA.)"
		align = left
		text-wrap = true
		allow-html = true
	elem "label14"
		type = LABEL
		pos = 269,84
		size = 168x20
		anchor1 = 39,18
		anchor2 = 63,22
		font-family = "Ebrima"
		font-size = 9
		font-style = "bold underline"
		text-color = #f8f8f8
		background-color = #111111
		saved-params = ""
		text = "COMMANDS"
	elem "label13"
		type = LABEL
		pos = 256,101
		size = 192x356
		anchor1 = 37,22
		anchor2 = 64,97
		font-family = "Ebrima"
		font-size = 8
		font-style = "bold"
		text-color = #ff0000
		saved-params = ""
		text = "A: ATTACK\nB: ROLEPLAY\nC: CONTACTS-LIST\nD: DEFEND/BLOCK\nF: THROW-PERSON\nG: GET/PICK-UP\nH: MEDITATE/SIT\nI: INVENTORY\nJ: JUTSUS/PASSIVES MENU\nM: RP-MODE\nO: OPTIONS MENU\nP: STATS MENU\nS: SPECIAL\nR: RECHARGE CHAKRA\nV: FOLLOW\nX: GRAB\n/: RUN\nTAB: TARGET\nSHIFT+TAB: UNTARGET\n1-5: HANDSEALS\nQ,W,E: HANDSEALS\nF1-F6: HOTSLOTS\nALT-ARROWS: Puppet Movement\nSPACE: EXECUTE JUTSU"
